<div class="col-md-5">
<div class="c-tl">
<h2>The Story of Magarpatta City</h2>
<p>The journey of 'Idea called Magarpatta' blossomed towards a phenomenal achievement over the years. Watch this journey unfold through the Coffee Table Book.</p>
