					<!-- MCG CITY -->
					<aside id="text-4" class="widget widget_text" style="display:none">
    <div class="textwidget">
        <div id="lbp-inline-href-1" style="padding: 10px; background: #fff; margin: 0 auto;">
            <div class="body_div">
                <div id="tabs" class="ui-tabs ui-widget ui-widget-content ui-corner-all">
                    <ul class="ui-tabs-nav ui-helper-reset ui-helper-clearfix ui-widget-header ui-corner-all" role="tablist">
                        <li id="t1" class="ui-state-default ui-corner-top ui-tabs-active ui-state-active" role="tab" tabindex="0" aria-selected="true">
                            <a href="#tabs-1" class="tab1 ui-tabs-anchor" aria-controls="tabs-1" role="presentation" id="ui-id-1"></a>
                        </li>
                        <li id="t2" class="ui-state-default ui-corner-top" role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false">
                            <a href="#tabs-2" class="tab2 ui-tabs-anchor" aria-controls="tabs-2" role="presentation" id="ui-id-2"></a>
                        </li>
                        <li id="t3" class="ui-state-default ui-corner-top" role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false">
                            <a href="#tabs-3" class="tab3 ui-tabs-anchor" aria-controls="tabs-3" role="presentation" id="ui-id-3"></a>
                        </li>
                        <li id="t4" class="ui-state-default ui-corner-top" role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false">
                            <a href="#tabs-4" class="tab4 ui-tabs-anchor" aria-controls="tabs-4" role="presentation" id="ui-id-4"></a>
                        </li>
                        <li id="t5" class="ui-state-default ui-corner-top" role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false">
                            <a href="#tabs-5" class="tab5 ui-tabs-anchor" aria-controls="tabs-5" role="presentation" id="ui-id-5"></a>
                        </li>
                        <li id="t6" class="ui-state-default ui-corner-top" role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false">
                            <a href="#tabs-6" class="tab6 ui-tabs-anchor" aria-controls="tabs-6" role="presentation" id="ui-id-6"></a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <div id="tabs-1" class="ui-tabs-panel ui-widget-content ui-corner-bottom" role="tabpanel" aria-expanded="true" aria-hidden="false">
                        <img src="https://www.magarpattacity.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/magarpatta.jpg" alt="Magarpatta City" width="470" height="467" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-186">
                        <span>Magarpatta City</span><br><br>
                        <p>Spread over 430 acres, Magarpatta City is an award-winning and internationally acclaimed model of integrated development and self-sustainability.</p>
                        <p>A city within a city, Magarpatta City is home to a commercial zone, residential neighborhoods, two schools, a multi-specialty hospital, a shopping mall, multiple restaurants, a gymkhana, and a large 25-acre serene park called Aditi Garden. All this is complemented by a verdant environment and a pollution-free ambiance - a supreme setting for life and business.</p>
                        <p>Through its sustainable development model, Magarpatta City has introduced eco-friendly development and has green spaces that make up 30 percent of the area. The implementation of comprehensive waste management and sustainable systems ensures further preservation of the environment.</p>
                        <p>It has won accolades at the Sydney World Congress of Metropolis, 2008, and the Maharashtra Economic Development Council lists Magarpatta City among the 'Top 10 success stories of the State'.</p>
                        <p>Today, the name Magarpatta City stands for quality in construction, innovation in design, and impeccable planning. It is the only fully functional and privately managed township in the country and is regarded as a remarkable reality; a reality born through immaculate vision and brilliant execution.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="tabs-2" class="ui-tabs-panel ui-widget-content ui-corner-bottom" role="tabpanel" aria-expanded="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
                        <img src="https://www.magarpattacity.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/nanded.jpg" alt="Nanded City" width="470" height="467" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-188">
                        <a href="https://www.nandedcitypune.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Nanded City</span></a><br><br>
                        <p>An aspiration of 235 farmer families, Nanded City, Pune is inspired by the internationally acclaimed Magarpatta City Model. Spread over a sprawling 700 acres, Nanded City is home to 1/2/2.5/3 BHK apartments, two schools, and several recreational facilities.</p>
                        <p>Nanded City, Pune stands as a haven of tranquillity in the current congested urban jungle scenario of Pune city. The impeccable township planning at Nanded City aims to create a sustainable environment that focuses on community living.</p>
                        <p>The vast 5.5 km water-lined stretch that adjoins the site lends a picturesque feel to the place. The soothing sound of silence, the twitter of birds, the fresh flowing breeze, the rustle of leaves, and the bright starry nights. All of nature is at your service at Nanded City.</p>
                        <p>Moreover, with vast areas reserved as green spaces, citizens of Nanded City enjoy pollution-free air, eco-friendly features, and self-sustainable systems; assuring a life that is truly in tune with nature.</p>
						<a href="https://www.nandedcitypune.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-brand">Know More</a>
                    </div>
                    <div id="tabs-3" class="ui-tabs-panel ui-widget-content ui-corner-bottom" role="tabpanel" aria-expanded="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
                        <img src="https://www.magarpattacity.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/seasons.jpg" alt="Seasons Mall" width="470" height="467" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-193">
                        <span>Seasons Mall</span><br><br>
                        <p>Seasons Mall is one of the largest shopping, dining, and entertainment destinations in Pune. It is a culmination of a few visionaries who took an ordinary idea of a shopping center and turned it into a world-class destination. Built on a 12-acre plot, the mall is located within Magarpatta City and represents a unique destination with stores, attractions, and services that combine to form the most comprehensive and integrated retail, hospitality, and entertainment complex. It is a place where people come to shop, play, dine, and have a memorable experience.</p>
                        <p>It is home to over 100 brands, a 25,000 sq. ft. food court, a 15-screen megaplex (the largest in the country), and a 90,000 sq. ft. hypermarket. The retail mix is truly varied, with something for every consumer. By delivering affordable luxury, the mall has distinguished itself as something truly spectacular on the retail landscape.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="tabs-4" class="ui-tabs-panel ui-widget-content ui-corner-bottom" role="tabpanel" aria-expanded="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
                        <img src="https://www.magarpattacity.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/Fotor0122174155.png" alt="Magarpatta City Council" width="470" height="467" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-194">
                        <span>Magarpatta City Council</span><br><br>
                        <p>Magarpatta City Council has been formed with the primary role of involving citizens in social, cultural, and sports activities. The idea of a council provides the unique opportunity to evolve to a more functional level for the betterment of both, the residents as well as the management.</p>
                        <p>The council is responsible for planning cultural functions, sports activities, health and medical camps for children, social awareness campaigns, and training activities for children and youth. It also plays an advisory role to the management for the maintenance of Magarpatta City.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="tabs-5" class="ui-tabs-panel ui-widget-content ui-corner-bottom" role="tabpanel" aria-expanded="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
                        <img src="https://magarpattacity.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/for-websitepnggsp.png" alt="Riverview City" width="470" height="467" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-194">
                        <a href="https://riverviewcity.com/" target="_blank"><span>Riverview City</span></a><br><br>
                        <p class="sppb5p">A lifestyle in a mega township that is just made for you</p>
                        <p>If you think while choosing a home, 'everything is here' is an impossible feature, then be assured that we are doing it for the third successive time. Welcome to the new 500 acres of brilliance called Riverview City, in Loni Kalbhor on the eastern side of Pune city. Living here is not only going to be a modern spectacularness but also the enhancement of 'ease to life'. A well-connected location that is in the vicinity of some of the important places in Pune city is blessed with the perfect sync of beautiful environment and modernity.</p>
                        <p>Focusing on the factor of convenience of living, this township is planned to balance your work life, school and college life, personal life, and your hobbies altogether. So come, let's book your relaxed life today!</p>
						<a href="https://riverviewcity.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-brand">Know More</a>
                    </div>
                    <div id="tabs-6" class="ui-tabs-panel ui-widget-content ui-corner-bottom" role="tabpanel" aria-expanded="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
                        <img src="https://magarpattacity.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/nova-elegance.jpg" alt="Nova Elegance" width="470" height="467" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-194">
                        <a href="https://novaproject.in/" target="_blank"><span>Nova Elegance</span></a><br><br>
                        <p class="sppb5p">Welcome to Nova Elegance, where opulence meets sophistication.</p>
                        <p><strong>From the makers of Magarpatta City</strong>, comes a premium residential project that redefines luxury living. Nestled in the heart of Mundhwa, Nova Elegance offers expansive 4.5 BHK homes and is designed for those who seek the pinnacle of comfort and style. Each residence boasts state-of-the-art amenities and panoramic views, creating an unparalleled living experience. The project seamlessly blends modern architecture with serene landscapes, ensuring a lifestyle of exclusivity, privacy, and tranquility. With top-notch security and world-class facilities, every detail is meticulously crafted to perfection, promising a life of grandeur and convenience. Embrace the epitome of luxury at Nova Elegance and announce your arrival in style.</p>
                        <a href="https://novaproject.in/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-brand">Know More</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</aside>

